Shut up!

259
00:16:16,073 --> 00:16:16,903
What?

260
00:16:16,986 --> 00:16:20,930
You're seriously telling me that Jocharo
could kick ass even as a little kid?

261
00:16:21,013 --> 00:16:25,153
I knew he was tough, but he was
that strong as a kid? Bites!

262
00:16:49,113 --> 00:16:51,893
You got off easy, friend,
but I can fix that.

263
00:17:06,453 --> 00:17:07,283
Lannibal!

264
00:17:07,366 --> 00:17:08,513
Stand, set,

265
00:17:08,893 --> 00:17:12,473
God of Chaos and Storms,
Alessi, 38 years old,

266
00:17:12,673 --> 00:17:14,908
single, and an unfortunate projectile,

267
00:17:15,113 --> 00:17:16,313
out of commission!

268
00:17:32,493 --> 00:17:34,193
Was all of that a dream?

269
00:17:40,953 --> 00:17:42,910
This earring belongs to that boy.

270
00:17:42,993 --> 00:17:45,093
So it really did happen.

271
00:17:45,873 --> 00:17:47,170
I don't know why!

272
00:17:47,253 --> 00:17:48,370
But for some reason!

273
00:17:48,453 --> 00:17:49,850
I couldn't move my body.

274
00:17:49,933 --> 00:17:51,290
That's right.

275
00:17:51,373 --> 00:17:53,510
I may not have been able to move!

276
00:17:53,593 --> 00:17:54,990
But I remember everything.

277
00:17:55,073 --> 00:17:57,330
That sweet little boy.

278
00:17:57,413 --> 00:17:59,230
Devoted himself to protecting me.

279
00:17:59,313 --> 00:18:00,870
And risked his life.

280
00:18:00,953 --> 00:18:02,490
By fighting against a grown man.

281
00:18:02,573 --> 00:18:05,173
He had such a brave and heroic heart.

282
00:18:05,813 --> 00:18:07,342
Oh, where did that boy go?

283
00:18:07,933 --> 00:18:08,763
Where?

284
00:18:08,933 --> 00:18:11,168
Where did my little knight run off to?

285
00:18:12,353 --> 00:18:13,533
Where did you go?

286
00:18:13,793 --> 00:18:14,773
Where are you?

287
00:18:17,813 --> 00:18:20,453
I've never met such an
amazing woman before.

288
00:18:21,153 --> 00:18:22,893
So kind. So genuine.

289
00:18:23,893 --> 00:18:27,658
That was a close one, but thankfully
I'm back to my normal self.

290
00:18:28,113 --> 00:18:29,833
I wonder if she's okay.

291
00:18:38,213 --> 00:18:39,370
I hate to bother you,

292
00:18:39,453 --> 00:18:41,510
but you didn't happen
to see a sweet little

293
00:18:41,593 --> 00:18:43,310
boy leave my house in
something of a hurry,

294
00:18:43,393 --> 00:18:44,223
did you?

295
00:18:44,873 --> 00:18:46,050
He has silver hair.

296
00:18:46,133 --> 00:18:49,015
Come to think of it, it
looks exactly like yours.

297
00:18:57,693 --> 00:19:00,987
Pardon me for asking, but
have the two of us met before?

298
00:19:05,993 --> 00:19:08,111
No, I didn't see a kid come through.

299
00:19:08,373 --> 00:19:09,902
Sorry I couldn't help you.

300
00:19:10,373 --> 00:19:11,373
Let's go, Jotaro.

301
00:19:14,133 --> 00:19:15,733
Come on, hurry up!

302
00:19:17,213 --> 00:19:18,053
Please wait!

303
00:19:18,833 --> 00:19:20,010
Could you be...

304
00:19:20,093 --> 00:19:22,533
That earring you're wearing...

305
00:19:23,613 --> 00:19:25,753
The two of us have never met before.

306
00:19:26,413 --> 00:19:27,613
It's not possible.

307
00:19:28,193 --> 00:19:29,958
My friend and I are travelers.

308
00:19:30,753 --> 00:19:34,459
So if you'll excuse us, there's
another town we need to get to.

309
00:19:35,173 --> 00:19:36,291
We'll be going now.

310
00:19:41,393 --> 00:19:43,093
It was only a dream.

311
00:19:43,773 --> 00:19:44,733
Too bad.

312
00:19:51,933 --> 00:19:54,213
Not a single word from you, Jotaro.

313
00:19:54,533 --> 00:19:55,945
I don't want to hear it.

314
00:20:02,273 --> 00:20:03,103
No!

315
00:20:03,186 --> 00:20:05,293
Joe Dario and Polnareff!

316
00:20:05,753 --> 00:20:08,390
Where in the world have
you two slackers been?

317
00:20:08,473 --> 00:20:09,453
Ah, Mr.

318
00:20:09,593 --> 00:20:10,753
Joestar and Avdol.

319
00:20:11,693 --> 00:20:15,670
How many times have I told the two of
you not to go wandering off on your own?

320
00:20:15,753 --> 00:20:17,350
Oh, you're in a position to talk.

321
00:20:17,433 --> 00:20:19,551
You're the one who just disappeared.

322
00:20:20,133 --> 00:20:20,963
Now, now.

323
00:20:21,173 --> 00:20:25,233
Why don't we focus on getting
something to eat? Huh? Hey Iggy!

324
00:20:25,413 --> 00:20:27,884
Where the hell have you been all day long?

325
00:20:40,013 --> 00:20:41,425
Can I take that for you?

326
00:20:44,693 --> 00:20:46,046
Yeah, thanks a million.

327
00:20:48,273 --> 00:20:51,390
It's about time, we're finally
getting a bit of relief.

328
00:20:51,473 --> 00:20:55,532
It was quite the late breakfast,
but I suppose it couldn't be helped.

329
00:20:56,253 --> 00:20:58,490
Yeah, since we've almost made it to Cairo,

330
00:20:58,573 --> 00:21:01,926
I think it's time we figured
out where Dio is hiding out.

331
00:21:03,193 --> 00:21:08,090
oh we're doing this will it
appear I'm not sure but given that

332
00:21:08,173 --> 00:21:12,793
we're so close the result should be
more precise all right here we go

333
00:21:20,133 --> 00:21:24,833
excuse me sir is there a problem over
here everything's fine mind your own

334
00:21:25,413 --> 00:21:26,493
Uh, yes.

335
00:21:30,413 --> 00:21:33,673
Old man, tell us, what is it?

336
00:21:34,033 --> 00:21:35,373
Just a little longer.

337
00:21:35,833 --> 00:21:37,373
I see something.

338
00:21:37,733 --> 00:21:39,453
It's getting clearer.

339
00:21:41,353 --> 00:21:42,893
Take a good look!

340
00:21:45,833 --> 00:21:46,910
There you have it, gentlemen!

341
00:21:46,993 --> 00:21:48,287
Our final destination!

342
00:22:28,333 --> 00:22:29,163
Thank you.

343
00:23:03,333 --> 00:23:04,163
Thank you.

344
00:23:28,213 --> 00:23:29,930
You're the one who fell for the scam.

345
00:23:30,013 --> 00:23:31,830
I've had just about enough of your games.

346
00:23:31,913 --> 00:23:33,710
Gambling is just like relationships.

347
00:23:33,793 --> 00:23:35,170
The one who cries loses.

348
00:23:35,253 --> 00:23:38,310
If he does anything that seems
suspicious, you can go home.

349
00:23:38,393 --> 00:23:40,450
If you're scared, exactly right.

350
00:23:40,533 --> 00:23:42,573
I'm going to bet my soul. Good?
